msgid ""
"The <b>POST</b> request method requests that a web server accept the "
"data enclosed in the body of the request message. It is often used "
"when uploading a file or when submitting a completed webform. In "
"contrast, the HTTP <b>GET</b> request method retrieves information "
"from the server."
msgstr ""
"Kaedah <b>POST</b> meminta pelayan web menerima data yang terkandung "
"dalam badan mesej permintaan. Ia sering digunakan apabila memuat naik "
"fail atau apabila menghantar borang web yang telah lengkap. "
"Sebaliknya, kaedah permintaan HTTP <b>GET</b> mendapatkan maklumat "
"daripada pelayan."

msgid "Request options"
msgstr "Pilihan permintaan"

msgid "Response data:"
msgstr "Data respons:"

msgid ""
"Custom composite sub elements do not support elements with multiple "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Sub-elemen komposit tersuai tidak menyokong elemen dengan berbilang "
"nilai."

msgid "Custom composite elements do not support the %type element."
msgstr "Elemen komposit tersuai tidak menyokong elemen %type."

