"Jika dibiarkan kosong, semua borang web akan dipaparkan dalam menu "
"pilihan."

msgid ""
"This is displayed after a draft or submission has been saved to the "
"database. The delete button is also included within the submission "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Ini dipaparkan selepas draf atau serahan telah disimpan ke dalam "
"pangkalan data. Butang padam juga disertakan dalam maklumat serahan."

msgid "Open delete confirmation form in a modal dialog."
msgstr "Buka borang pengesahan pemadaman dalam dialog modal."

msgid "<code>:clear</code> removes the token when it is not replaced."
msgstr ""
"<code>:clear</code> akan mengalih keluar token apabila token tersebut "
"tidak digantikan."

