"href=\":href_62x\">6.2.x</a>), kemudian ekstrakkan direktori dan fail "
"ke /libraries atau /web/libraries"

msgid "Use a lazy builder to render the form after the page is built/loaded."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan **lazy builder** untuk merender borang selepas halaman "
