msgid ""
"If you enjoy and value Drupal and the Webform module consider <a "
"href=\":href_involved\">getting involved in the Drupal community</a>, "
"<a href=\":href_join\">joining the Drupal Association</a>, and <a "
"href=\":href_opencollective\">contributing funds to the Webform "
"module's Open Collective</a>."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda menikmati dan menghargai Drupal serta modul Webform, "
"pertimbangkan <a href=\":href_involved\">untuk melibatkan diri dalam "
"komuniti Drupal</a>, <a href=\":href_join\">menyertai Persatuan "
"Drupal</a>, dan <a href=\":href_opencollective\">menyumbang dana "
"kepada Open Collective bagi modul Webform</a>."

msgid "This behavior is not supported when Ajax is enabled."
msgstr "Perilaku ini tidak disokong apabila Ajax diaktifkan."

msgid ""
"If checked, the browser back button will submit the previous page and "
"navigate back emulating the behavior of user clicking a wizard or "
"preview page's back button."
msgstr ""
"Jika ditandakan, butang belakang pada pelayar akan menghantar semula "
"halaman sebelumnya dan kembali seperti meniru gelagat pengguna yang "
"menekan butang belakang pada halaman wizard atau halaman pratonton."

